@startuml check-flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:read the settings and\nevery requirement document;
:collect every error\n(do not stop at the first one);
if (any error?) then (yes)
  :print each error\nwith its file and line;
  :exit code 1;
else (no)
  :exit code 0;
endif
stop

note right
  Runs in three places, without network:
  * on the machine of the Maintainer
  * by the agent, after it writes
  * as a check of a pull request
end note
@enduml
